  m_Name: VerseOne_DialogueData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Messages:
  - To obtain a Moon Fragment, you will be challenged to recall a phrase from the
    Ancient Prayer.
  - "You\u2019ll go through a series of prompts or questions, and you\u2019ll have
    to select out of three choices which answer is the correct one to the prompt
    or question. "
  - "You\u2019ll have access to your Cluebook to aid you in your deductions. "
  - "In the top-left corner, there\u2019s a Health meter. Selecting the wrong choice
    will reduce your health. When your health reaches zero, it will be Game Over. "
  - If you answer all the prompts or questions correctly, you will obtain a Moon
    Fragment, be sent back to the Full Moon Statue to return the Moon Fragment, and
    it will advance to the next day.
  - "Make sure you\u2019re certain in your answers to the questions or prompts, and
    remember to check your Cluebook to provide you with clues to the correct answers.
    Time for the first question:"
  - A low voice awakens from within the Moon Statue before you...
  - 'Before a single prayer was spoken to the Moon, the people first had to understand
    how to gain an audience with Her Grace. '
  - How did the devoted first introduce themselves to the Moon?
  ButtonOneText: We command thee, eternal Moon, to hear our voices.
  ButtonTwoText: We gather before thee, eternal Moon, as humble followers.
  ButtonThreeText: 'We kneel beneath thee, eternal Moon, and offer our reverence. '
  correctButtonNumber: 3
